  "markdown": {
    "instructions": "Valora Payments API (Brazil: Pix, card, boleto). Base URL https://api.valorapayments.com.br, Authorization: Bearer sk_vl_... used only on the server. Request amounts are reais as strings (\"149.90\"); response amounts are integer cents (14990). Use POST /v1/checkouts for card and boleto; POST /v1/payments only creates Pix and should send an Idempotency-Key. Confirm payments only through the payment.succeeded webhook after verifying X-Valora-Signature (hex HMAC-SHA256 of \"<t>.<raw body>\"), dedupe by event.id and check livemode. Never invent endpoints or fields: check /llms.txt and /openapi.json."
  },
